{"type":"message","id":"f3eaf01e","parentId":"b7f266be","timestamp":"2026-02-01T03:29:16.257Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's what I built:\n\n## ✅ Lebbie's Luxury Chocolates — Complete\n\n**🌐 Live URL: https://commerce-mayor-appearance-cinema.trycloudflare.com**\n\n### What's there:\n- **Stunning single-page landing site** with luxury chocolate brand feel — deep browns, gold accents, cream backgrounds, Playfair Display typography\n- **Hero** → Origin Story → 4 Collections (Salone, Paris, Milano, Charm City) → The Craft process → Meet Doug → Waitlist signup → Footer\n- **Four bon bon collections** inspired by his real journey — including Old Bay caramel and Berger cookie for Baltimore\n- **Warm, personal copy** telling his PIH/Sierra Leone/Milan/Paris story without being corporate\n- **Scroll animations**, mobile responsive, fully self-contained single HTML file\n- **Business plan** at `BUSINESS-PLAN.md` with market analysis, pricing, startup costs (~$6.9K), path to $2K/month, and how it fits the $15K/month goal\n\n### PM2 processes:\n- `lebbie-chocolates` — serving on port 3100\n- `lebbie-tunnel` — cloudflared tunnel to public URL"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":290,"cacheRead":25718,"cacheWrite":112,"totalTokens":26121,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.00725,"cacheRead":0.012858999999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0007,"total":0.020814}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1769916546150}}
